parts:
{
  "prompt": "A highly detailed image of a Star Wars X-Wing fighter, with World War II-style nose art inspired by aerial victory markings. The fuselage shows a metallic silver surface with a matte finish, and is decorated with rows of stylized black and red TIE Fighter silhouettes painted as kill marks. These are arranged in a grid pattern similar to WWII aircraft markings. There are engraved identification texts including a fictional serial number and pilot name. The canopy is open, and the cockpit is visible. Lighting is neutral daylight with a cloudy sky.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A close-up, high-resolution digital photograph of the side of a Star Wars Rebel Alliance X-Wing starfighter (T-65), focusing on the cockpit area. The shot should resemble a WWII fighter plane aesthetic, similar in framing to a vintage aircraft nose art photo. The pilot name 'LT. WEDGE ANTILLES' is stenciled on the side near the canopy in bold, blue military-style font. The rest of the lower fuselage is clean of text but features visible black scuff marks, blaster damage, and burn marks from past battles. The surface is weathered with scratches and chipped paint. Natural lighting, no dramatic angles, and no lower technical text like model or serial numbers.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A highly detailed close-up view of the side of a Rebel Alliance X-Wing starfighter. The frame is tightly cropped, centered around the canopy and pilot's nameplate 'LT. WEDGE ANTILLES' painted clearly. The surrounding metal features realistic battle damage, black scorch marks, and laser pitting. The view includes just enough of the iconic fuselage paneling and part of the canopy to unmistakably identify it as an X-Wing. The composition is square, suitable for text overlay, with ample negative space around the nameplate. Soft, natural lighting highlights the texture of the worn starfighter hull.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A high-resolution, close-up view of a worn and weathered X-Wing starfighter fuselage (Incom T-65 model) from Star Wars, zoomed in near the cockpit. The name 'WEDGE ANTILLES' is stenciled above TIE Fighter kill markings. The panel is scratched, battle-damaged, with black scorch marks and chipped paint. The background is a deep space scene, featuring stars and distant nebulae, enhancing the sci-fi setting. Lighting is realistic with soft shadows.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A detailed close-up of Wedge Antilles' T-65 X-Wing starfighter, showing the worn fuselage with kill markings, olive-green and gray panels, and visible battle damage. The cockpit canopy is partially visible. In the background, space is filled with stars and several other X-Wing starfighters flying in formation, adding depth and scale. The overall scene has a cinematic quality, with dramatic lighting and a dark outer space backdrop.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A stylized parody poster mimicking the iconic Star Wars Episode I poster, set in the desert with a beige sand background and a curved adobe-like building. The character Anakin Skywalker is replaced by DJ Clay, wearing a red t-shirt with a Juggalo face print, red cap, and tattoos visible on his arms and neck. He is walking in a similar pose to Anakin in the original poster. The long shadow on the building wall is no longer Darth Vader, but now takes the shape of the Hatchetman logo—a silhouette of a figure running with a hatchet. The lighting and layout remain cinematic and dramatic.",
  "size": "1024x1536"
}

{
  "prompt": "A dramatic promotional poster inspired by Star Wars Episode I, featuring a desert landscape with soft lighting and a large, curved sci-fi adobe structure casting a shadow on the sand. In place of the original character, a stylized fictional hip-hop artist stands in a low-angle pose wearing a red shirt and cap, looking down. The shadow cast behind the figure is shaped like a custom hatchet-wielding silhouette, reminiscent of a logo but not identical to any trademarked symbol. The color palette features warm sand tones, muted oranges, and sharp shadows. The top half of the frame is empty desert and sky, leaving space for promotional text. No recognizable characters or logos are used.",
  "size": "1024x1536"
}

{
  "prompt": "A high-resolution, cinematic scene of a Tatooine-style Star Wars desert landscape featuring a large, weathered adobe hut with soft shadows on a sandy surface. The sky is clear and blue. In front of the hut, where a person might stand, there is no character, but instead, a pair of futuristic Star Wars-inspired sneakers placed on the ground. The shoes have a rugged, sci-fi aesthetic with desert-worn textures and subtle glowing elements. The scene is empty and quiet, emphasizing the mysterious presence of only the shoes in the environment.",
  "size": "square"
}

{
  "prompt": "A pair of Star Wars–inspired futuristic sneakers placed on desert sand, viewed from a low front-facing perspective as if a person is standing on a flat surface. The shoes feature weathered textures, subtle sci-fi design elements like metallic accents and angular contours, with a color palette of desert tones (tan, gray, rust red). The lighting is warm and directional, simulating a late afternoon sun, with soft shadows beneath the shoes. No background objects or people—just the shoes and textured sand surface.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A pair of original sci-fi sneakers inspired by Star Wars design aesthetics, positioned in a low-angle frontal view on a flat desert surface with soft shadows. The sneakers feature weathered textures, muted desert colors (sand, gray, rust-orange), modular armored plating, utility straps, and subtle glowing accents. Designed to resemble rebel pilot gear or starfighter mechanics. No logos, no background characters, just the shoes isolated in the correct cinematic orientation, suitable for compositing.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A pair of futuristic, sci-fi inspired sneakers placed on a flat neutral surface, viewed from a low frontal angle as if worn by a person standing in dramatic light. The shoes have design cues reminiscent of space pilot gear: rugged textures, reinforced soles, weathered leather or fabric, metallic accents, muted colors like gray, orange, and white. The style is practical and functional, suitable for a space traveler. The background is plain and non-distracting. High detail and realism.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}
